  "name": "Transits Count",
  "slug": "transits-count",
  "teaser": "Because BSG does what BSG does and doesn't update everything. Make transits count.",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/lo7PsodQHCVXu7ug5Ngj7BXGbUfLmKyQYYJJtmxj.png",
  "downloads": 557,
  "favourites_count": 15,
  "description": "<p>Add Transit as a valid condition to quests who require survival from a location. Does not add it to quests that require a specific exfil name or zone.</p>\n<p>Adds transit to the following vanilla quests:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Supply Plans</li>\n<li>Health Care Privacy - Part 2</li>\n<li>Health Care Privacy - Part 3</li>\n<li>Signal - Part 1</li>\n<li>The Survivalist Path - Zhivchik</li>\n<li>Hustle</li>\n<li>Tourists</li>\n<li>Immunity</li>\n<li>Against the Conscience - Part 1 PVE ZONE</li>\n</ul>\n<p>It will also add it to any Mod Quest that has the same requirements as long as they are in the database prior to this mod loading.</p>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">INSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Installation</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Download Transits Count</li>\n<li>Open the downloaded 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Select the SPT folder in the 7z file in 7-zip</li>\n<li>Drag the SPT folder from 7-zip into your root SPT folder</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Demonstration Video (yoink):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"34vXXDj.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">UNINSTALLATION</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>Delete <code>/ROOTSPT/SPT/user/mods/acidphantasm-transitscount</code></li>\n<li>Done</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n<p>If you enjoy my work - you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/acidphantasm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a>~</p>\n",
